OL,3,AAttempted murder arrests after boy, 16,
OL,4,Aattacked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 37-year-old man and a 41-year-old
OL,7,Fwoman have also been arrested on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of assisting an offender. All
OL,9,Ffour remain in custody, Merseyside
OL,10,FPolice said.
OL,12,FDet Ch Insp Paula Jones said: "We are
OL,13,Fcontinuing to appeal for anyone who was
OL,14,Fin the area of Breck Road shortly after
OL,15,F14:00 and saw, heard or captured
OL,16,Fanything to please get in touch."
